  message: "Phase 1 implementation done on jgstern-agent/feat/wi-pimig-go-marshal-callback-entrypoints. New go-encoding-callbacks.yaml with 8 patterns matching the standard marshal/unmarshal method names (UnmarshalJSON, MarshalJSON, UnmarshalYAML, MarshalYAML, UnmarshalText, MarshalText, UnmarshalBinary, MarshalBinary). New serialization_callback concept handler in entrypoints.py maps to LIBRARY_EXPORT at 0.80 confidence with custom 'Serialization callback' label. Framework loader updated to always load the new YAML alongside other convention files. 7 new tests cover positive matches, language scoping, method-vs-function guard, concept→entrypoint mapping, and dedup. Phase 2 (caller-site detection) and Phase 3 (synthetic dispatches_to edges) deferred — will file follow-ups if Phase 1 validates on next DEEP bakeoff."  # 8eea
