  message: "Validation bakeoff complete (2026-04-11). Pre-fix baseline (run-2026-04-10-smoke-test, before PR #2942) showed 92 marshal methods in alertmanager dead-code list: Config.UnmarshalYAML, Route.UnmarshalYAML, *.MarshalJSON, *.UnmarshalJSON, *.UnmarshalText, *.MarshalBinary across receiver types (Secret, URL, Matcher, Regexp, TimeRange, Location, HostPort, 40+ notification config types, and many more). Post-fix run on current dev HEAD (/tmp/validation/alertmanager): ZERO marshal methods remain in the dead-code list — all 92 eliminated (100%). Phase 1 entrypoint classification works as designed: the 8 serialization_callback concept patterns correctly flag these methods as LIBRARY_EXPORT, removing them from the dead-code candidate pool. WI-pimig Phase 1 validated. Phase 2 (caller-site type matching) and Phase 3 (synthetic dispatches_to edges) remain deferred and are not required for the marshal-method dead-code false-positive elimination goal."  # 1868
